    {
      "id": "claim_83f35e061b544a33a139604b187b6cd2",
      "statement": "The server's chat_model(context) and the CLI's default_model(options) both delegate to langchain_chess.chat_models.chat_model, which calls init_chat_model with max_tokens set to an output budget (MAX_TOKENS=64000, covering reasoning, lowered to a known model output limit and to half of a small context window), a name equal to the model_identity model part for trace spans, and reasoning_effort only when it is not None because models without reasoning reject the parameter.",
