    {
      "id": "claim_34f8c18deb8b4b839d83cc322d613720",
      "statement": "ServerSettings rejects a set-but-empty LANGSMITH_GATEWAY_API_KEY, TYPESAFE_API_KEY or TYPESAFE_BASE_URL because the .env template's ${LC_GATEWAY_KEY} expansion yields an empty string that langchain-core would silently replace with the tracing key; make_graph instantiates it only for runs (reads without an execution runtime get the credential-free shape() graph), and typesafe() raises when either TypeSafe variable is unset.",
