      "id": "claim_1932a7420f384fe7a0e583952d3f9c2b",
      "statement": "For langsmith: specs, whose gateway ChatOpenAI has no profile, chat_model sets profile max_input_tokens to the genai-prices context window minus the output budget (no profile when genai-prices doesn't know the model), and caps the budget by the vendor integration's own max_output_tokens when that integration is installed, otherwise keeping MAX_TOKENS.",
