      "id": "claim_a6478fa783054e14889040c638295ba7",
      "statement": "When the model-call handler raises after at least one response was recorded, ChessCore keeps those calls in the turn update with a failed_call marker and after_model re-raises the error later; with no recorded calls the error propagates directly, and overflow-looking errors become ContextBudgetError.",
